Error Handling
The system provides clear error messages for:

    Non-existent nodes

    Attempts to use faulty nodes as start/end points

    Invalid operations on faulty nodes
    Also gives error for nodes which does not exits/ out of maze.
    Invalidates for negative nodes 



Implementation Notes

    Uses Dijkstra's algorithm for guaranteed shortest paths

    Implements dynamic programming with memoization for efficiency

    Maintains consistent state through automatic cache invalidation

    All edges have equal weight (1) for maze navigation
